      "creator": "Seller",
      "description": "• A how-to video on product usage that demonstrates how to disassemble, clean, and reassemble the water pump from a tabletop water fountain. • Disassembly involves pulling off the front casing, untwisting the small impeller seal cover, and using a thin wire or pin to lift out the central magnetic rotor. • Cleaning is done by placing all parts in a bowl of clear water and scrubbing with a cotton swab and small brush to remove grime from the pump body, casing, and rotor. • Reassembly reverses the process: the magnetic rotor is placed back into the center slot, the rotor cover is twisted securely into position, and the front screen is snapped back onto the frame.",
